  "description": "CACGIB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C27 H30 Dy3 N7 O22,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.552-3.572 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.69-98.87°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy3(O)(OH)(o-pbd)3(NO3)4(H2O)2]·2NO3·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
